SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Soulas (Silas)\, Soroni
LOCATION:Soroni\, Rhodes\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The biggest country fair on Rhodes: a two-week run of events in the pine woods around the Agios Soulas hermitage above Soroni\, peaking on 28-30 July with donkey and horse races on the little hippodrome\, a contest for the best traditional reed hut (kalyva)\, souvlaki stalls and dancing to local bands. People come from every village on the island\, so arrive before sunset on the 29th to park anywhere near the site.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#soroni-panigiri-of-agios-soulas-silas-soroni
